FedSCAD

The federated training framework is adapted from the FedDF codebase:

Tao Lin, Lingjing Kong, Sebastian U. Stich, and Martin Jaggi.
Ensemble Distillation for Robust Model Fusion in Federated Learning.
Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems, 2020.

The upstream Apache License 2.0 is included in LICENSES/FedDF.txt.
Existing source copyright and attribution notices are retained.

Changes include fixed shared-anchor supervision, class-score knowledge
distillation, accumulated history correction, supported models and data
configurations, and release documentation. Unrelated baseline and
security-experiment entry points were removed.
